></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take time into account and make sure your snakes needs are met each day. Be prepared for weather that can affect your snakes work and changing seasons that bring new mechanics to the mix.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>RESEARCH &amp; DEVELOPMENT</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3291850/extras/34dc330c9c93283a2924f1485211eb15.avif?t=1770919957\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3291850/extras_big/34dc330c9c93283a2924f1485211eb15.avif?t=1770919957 width=800 height=450 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build a lab and with the help of your snakes, perform research to unlock new types of snakes, buildings and improvements for your ranch.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DECORATE AND MAKE IT YOUR OWN</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3291850/extras/ab7a25c4a2d98ea1db1e20498ebff341.apng?t=1770919957\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3291850/extras/ab7a25c4a2d98ea1db1e20498ebff341.poster.avif?t=1770919957\" class=\"bb_img\" width=594 height=300 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from a variety of decorative items and add your own style to your ranch. Just because you are scaling up, doesn\u2019t mean you cannot do a glow up instead.</p>","developers":["Flannel Bear Games"],"dlc":[4253620],"genres":[{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3291850/header.jpg?t=1770919957","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul c